  message: "mulul run 2026-10-03, branch jgstern-agent/fix/mulul-catalogue-rows (worktree ~/hg_wt/mulul, local only, not pushed), commit 2a02346d00. rust.yaml std::process [exit, abort] and the same-shape elixir.yaml System.halt removed from subprocess; their 3 HIGH_RISK_EXEMPTIONS_SUBPROCESS entries removed; new reverse guard: every exemption must name a live subprocess row. Repro (one-file rust fixture, env::var -> process::exit): no-subprocess and host_secret->subprocess VIOLATED -> INCONCLUSIVE (\"calls into module(s) the I/O catalog could not classify (std::env, std::process)\"); the \"launches an external program\" sentence is gone. Elixir System.halt fixture: same. Corpus io-boundaries A/B: netavark's 4 std::process.exit subprocess chains -> external_potential, nothing else moved. Tests: red 29 failed / 50 passed on the new files before the fix; full affected selection after: 17897 passed, 1 failed (a pinned audit row for item INV-zufiz, fixed in 610beef105), coverage 100%. NOT done: a std::process completeness grant (would make these CONFIRMED) -- blocked on the pid ruling, filed WI-kizur-jizon-gadov-bomud-sakav-kusog-hazur-bokiz. Residual same-family rows (swift fatalError family under process_send, erlang exit/1): WI-livod-fozoz-vanus-sobas-sudus-radog-rakat-gakuv. Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/mulul.md (draft closure note there)."  # 46ff
